#    Author             : Nithya Murugesan
#    Input              : acctNum,bankName,branchName,schm_desc,acctDateRange,extn_desc
#    Output             : It gives the pass sheet printing report
#    Called Script      : NA
#    Calling Script     : pspfull1.mrt
#    Menu Option        :
#    Srl. No        Date            Author          Description.
#    -------        ----            ------          ----------------
#    1.0          22-07-2013      Nithya Murugesan  Original Version.
